from. The first entry appears with the first review finding that describes a rule.>

## Tests

The common layer — `${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/presets/python/tests.md`: a case starts from the business case, layout
mirrors the code, the name names a scenario, next to "it worked" sits a counter-case, data comes through
factories, the substitution mechanics live in the boundary fixture. Here — only what is different
or stricter in THIS project.

